    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80126" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παυσι-κάπη</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], ἡ, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάπτω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>projecting
